      ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000001090', 'orchid-magnets-atelier-10', 'LumaPrint', 'LumaPrint brings an urban sensibility to unlimited magnets from its Beersheba base. It travels nationwide; couples can add extra photographer and black-and-white option within the classic package.'),
      ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000001119', 'kinneret-social-house-17', 'Rega Social', 'Rega Social pairs 24-hour delivery with behind the scenes for modern celebrations. Based in Netanya, the team serves sharon and jerusalem and offers an essential package with dance-floor clips.'),
      ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000001163', 'carmel-experiences-atelier-17', 'Tandem Live', 'Based in Rehovot, Tandem Live offers a focused mix of roaming musicians, interactive dance team, and fire-safe cold sparks. The wedding attraction suits luxury and modern events, serves central israel and jerusalem, and has an essential package structure.'),
      ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000001168', 'mosaic-experiences-works-22', 'Simcha Nova Wedding Entertainment', 'A party / festival wedding attraction from Beersheba, Simcha Nova Wedding Entertainment focuses on interactive dance team, fire-safe cold sparks, and clear planning. Its classic option includes saxophone set; it serves south and jerusalem and north.'),
